;; Card d28f118e (Brindle S9): the cornered options go cheapest first, the stand priced with every mob that hits it. A pit 5x5,
;; 3 deep (no way out), cut in a stone mass; the body in it unarmed with 16 dirt and resistance. Should-succeed: a NoAI creeper
;; 2 off is already in swell range (walls would not stop its blast), so the body stands (a :pause hold) before any walls.
;; The body faces the creeper (yaw 270, east): a creeper is silent, so out of the view cone it is never known and hostile-near never fires.
;; Should-fail (the stand): with a NoAI zombie in reach as well, standing is priced with its blows and the walls come first.
{:defaults
 {:tags [:hostile :survival :cornered :creeper]
  :time :any
  :mobs :keep
  :register [{:trigger :hostile-near}]
  :blocks [[:fill [2 0 8] [20 3 22] "stone"]
           [:fill [8 1 13] [12 3 17] "air"]]
  :body {:at [9.5 1 15.5] :yaw 270 :effects [["resistance" 600 3]] :inventory [["dirt" 16]]}
  :limit-s 45}
 :cases
 [{:name "cornered-beside-a-creeper-in-swell-range-stands"
   :act [[:summon "creeper" [11.5 1 15.5] "{NoAI:1b}"]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot :pause}} :within-s 30}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot :plug}} :for-s 30 :until {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot :pause}}}]}
  {:name "cornered-beside-a-creeper-and-a-zombie-walls-first"
   :act [[:summon "creeper" [11.5 1 15.5] "{NoAI:1b}"]
         [:summon "zombie" [9.5 1 14.0] "{NoAI:1b}"]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot :plug}} :within-s 30}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot :pause}} :for-s 30 :until {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot :plug}}}]}]}
